.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Represents a model‑executable tool that can be exposed to \fBAI\fP backends through an IAIFunctionFactory\&. 

An \fBIModelTool<T>\fP defines a named operation with a description, a parameter schema, and an asynchronous execution method\&. 
.br
 Model backends may convert these tools into runtime‑callable functions when supported, enabling structured tool‑use inside model pipelines\&. 

.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIT\fP The prompt type used by the model backend when invoking the tool\&. 
.RE
.PP

