.SS "Task< object?> SystemEx\&.AI\&.IModelTool< T >\&.ExecuteAsync (Map< string, object?> args, CancellationToken ct)"

.PP
Executes the tool asynchronously using the provided argument dictionary\&. 
.br
 The backend supplies validated parameters and a cancellation token\&. 
.br
 The returned object must be serializable or convertible into a model‑usable form\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIargs\fP A map containing the tool parameters mapped by name\&. 
.br
\fIct\fP A cancellation token used to abort execution if required by the backend\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
A task producing the tool's result, or \fRnull\fP if no output is generated\&. 
.RE
